================================================================
CONTEXT_INCLUDE_CODE HUNT — Pixel Watch 2 System Services
Date: 2026-09-11
================================================================

OBJECTIVE: Find createPackageContext/createPackageContextAsUser calls
using CONTEXT_INCLUDE_CODE (flag 1 or 3 = INCLUDE_CODE|IGNORE_SECURITY)
in system services on the Pixel Watch 2, similar to CVE-2026-49881
(InCallController.serviceClassExists).

